WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.716
These are the main ideas to remember Normalize text
deliberately

00:00:05.742 --> 00:00:11.467
and keep validation separate from transformation Use
string structure

00:00:11.493 --> 00:00:18.344
when parsing Choose temporal types based on meaning
Remember

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.570
that EXTRACT reads a component while DATE_TRUNC
creates a time bucket Use

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:30.159
PostgreSQL interval arithmetic for elapsed and
shifted time And

00:00:30.185 --> 00:00:33.685
keep dates and timestamps typed until you truly need
display text
